1. Definitions

1.1 "Software" means TokenHub, including its source code, object code,
    Docker images, installation scripts, documentation, UI designs,
    logos, and any modifications or derivative works thereof.
1.2 "Licensor" means 黔前智算 (Qianqian Zhisuan).
1.3 "You" means any individual or organization that obtains, installs,
    uses, copies, or modifies the Software.
1.4 "Non-Commercial Use" means the following uses, provided they do not
    directly or indirectly generate revenue or serve the business
    operations of a for-profit organization:
    (a) use by an individual for learning, research, hobby, or personal
        purposes;
    (b) use by an educational institution (such as a school or research
        institute) or a legally registered non-profit/charitable
        organization for teaching, research, or charitable activities.
1.5 "Commercial Use" means any use other than Non-Commercial Use,
    including without limitation:
    (a) deployment or use by a company, sole proprietorship, government
        agency, public institution, or other organization in its
        business, production, or internal operations (except the
        evaluation described in Section 3);
    (b) providing services to third parties using the Software
        (including SaaS, hosting, API resale, or managed operations);
    (c) selling, renting, or bundling the Software or derivative works,
        or including them in any paid product, solution, or delivery
        project;
    (d) use by an individual for paid services or for-profit activities.

